---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const crumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: `${base}/` }, { label: 'About us' }];
---
<Base title="About us" description="Who publishes Global Sports Archive, what we cover, and how we check every figure before it goes on the site." crumbs={crumbs}>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">The publisher</p>
      <h1>About us</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        Global Sports Archive is a reference site about the history of sport. Where most
        sports media chases today's result and lets the record books rot, we do the
        opposite: we keep complete, checked archives of who won what, and when.
      </p>

      <h2>What we publish</h2>
      <p>
        Twelve sports are covered in depth, with a further eight covered more lightly.
        Every archive page states how far its data has been verified, and against which
        sources. Where a season or tournament has not yet been confirmed, we say so on
        the page rather than guess.
      </p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Every article is written for this site. We do not republish or translate other outlets' work.</li>
        <li>Facts are confirmed against at least two independent sources before publication.</li>
        <li>Team crests and press photography are not used. Illustrations are our own.</li>
        <li>Corrections are made openly, with the change noted on the page.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The full method is set out in our <a href={`${base}/editorial-policy/`}>editorial policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p class="note">
        ЗАМЕСТИТЕЛ — тук влизат реалното име на издателя, кратка биография на автора и
        адрес за кореспонденция. AdSense и E-E-A-T изискват разпознаваем издател;
        липсата му е честа причина за отказ.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Corrections, questions and press enquiries: <a href={`${base}/contact/`}>contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
